            "text_KwYhM8": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>At our NYC jewelry store, Anna Sheffield offers a truly personalized experience through her renowned custom jewelry and bespoke services. Clients are guided step-by-step from initial sketch to the final handcrafted piece, ensuring every detail reflects their vision. For those dreaming of a one-of-a-kind wedding ring in white gold or seeking to redesign a cherished heirloom into something new, our team brings your ideas to life with thoughtful craftsmanship.We also offer virtual consultations, allowing clients near and far to collaborate with our design experts in real time. Specializing in bespoke bridal jewelry and heirloom transformations, Anna Sheffield’s Atelier combines artistry and sentiment to create meaningful, lasting pieces. From the first design concept to the final polished setting, every piece is a reflection of your story, elegantly crafted in our signature style. Begin your custom journey with us today.</p>",
                "width": "fit-content",
                "max_width": "normal",
                "alignment": "left",
                "type_preset": "rte",
